sequenceDiagram
actor Contributor
participant Mobile
participant API
participant Places
participant Storage
participant DB
Contributor->>Mobile: Search and select place
Mobile->>API: Search location
API->>DB: Local search
opt Insufficient local results
API->>Places: Provider search
end
Contributor->>Mobile: Capture in app or select recent gallery photo; location optional
Mobile->>Mobile: Capture GPS + accuracy, compare selected place within 30 m
Mobile->>API: Request signed intents + per-media capture metadata
API-->>Mobile: mediaIds + short-lived PUT URLs
Mobile->>Storage: PUT media to private staging
loop Bounded batches covering selected photos/videos
Mobile->>API: POST pre-scan + staged mediaIds + selected tags
API-->>Mobile: Quality and optional Python AI hints
end
Contributor->>Mobile: Review pre-scan and confirm Submit
Mobile->>API: POST JSON submission + owned mediaIds + key
API->>Places: Resolve selected external place if needed
API->>Storage: Verify media and capture metadata, finalize outside transaction
API->>DB: Transaction: location, submission, attached media, claims, job, replay record
DB-->>API: Commit
API->>API: Best-effort Hangfire enqueue after commit, recurring reconciliation backs it up
API-->>Mobile: 202 Accepted + submissionId
